---
---

<section id="mission" class="section mission-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-text">
        <h2>Stories Slipping Away</h2>
        <p>
          Every day, we lose the voices of those who crossed oceans to build new lives in Australia.
          Their children and grandchildren often never hear the full story—in their native tongue,
          with all the emotion, detail, and wisdom it deserves.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Recolo</strong> captures these memories through intimate, AI-powered conversations
          that speak your language—Italian, Vietnamese, Greek, Chinese, and many more.
        </p>
        <p class="mission-highlight">
          Not just a biography. An investigative journey into your life, conducted by an AI
          journalist who knows how to listen.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-image">
        <div class="vintage-placeholder">
          <div class="ocean-pattern"></div>
          <div class="placeholder-content">
            <div class="ship-icon">⛵</div>
            <h3>Stories Worth Preserving</h3>
            <p>Every immigrant carries memories across oceans</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission-section {
    background-color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mission-text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ocean-900);
  }

  .mission-text p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .mission-highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-sunrise-light) 0%, var(--color-paper) 100%);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-ocean-900);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .vintage-placeholder {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-ocean-800) 0%, var(--color-ocean-900) 100%);
    border: 12px solid var(--color-paper-dark);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ocean-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent,
      transparent 10px,
      rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.1) 10px,
      rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.1) 20px
    );
  }

  .placeholder-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .ship-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .placeholder-content h3 {
    color: var(--color-sunrise);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .placeholder-content p {
    color: var(--color-sunrise-light);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .mission-image {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
